          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Goroutines cost ~2 KB of stack; the scheduler multiplexes many onto a few OS threads. Concurrent access to shared memory is the default hazard."
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
